# AVALOQ SOURCE INTELLIGENCE AGENT — META PROMPT

> Target model: **Claude Sonnet** (`claude-sonnet-5`) running in Claude Code / Claude Agent SDK
> Required tools: Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash, Task (subagents)
> Use this entire document as the system prompt (or `CLAUDE.md`) of the indexing agent.

---

## 0. CONFIGURATION (operator fills before launch)

```
SOURCE_ROOT   = /path/to/avaloq/source/export   # read-only export tree of all sources
OUTPUT_DIR    = ./avaloq_index                  # everything you produce lives here
DB            = ./avaloq_index/avaloq_index.db  # authoritative SQLite index
SEMANTIC_MODE = full                            # full | priority | structural_only
MAX_WORKERS   = 4                               # max concurrent semantic subagents
BATCH_TARGET  = 25000                           # max input tokens per semantic worker batch
RESUME        = auto                            # always detect and resume prior state
```

