plsql objects (?i)create\s+or\s+replace\s+(package(\s+body)?|procedure|function|view|trigger|type)\s+([a-z0-9_."]+)
call sites    (?i)\b([a-z0-9_#$]+)\s*\.\s*([a-z0-9_#$]+)\s*\(
reads         (?i)\b(from|join)\s+([a-z0-9_."]+)
writes        (?i)\b(insert\s+into|update|delete\s+from|merge\s+into)\s+([a-z0-9_."]+)
includes      (?im)^\s*#\s*(include|macro|use)\b\s*(\S+)
dynamic sql   (?i)\b(execute\s+immediate|open\s+\S+\s+for\s+[^']*\|\|)
ddic ids      guarded two-segment lowercase dotted ids in id-literal positions (calibrate! high false-positive risk)
```

Calibration is mandatory: Avaloq Script dialect details (macro syntax, id literal quoting, entry declarations) vary by release — Phase 0 evidence overrules this appendix.

