## APPENDIX E — HOW TO RUN (operator notes)

1. Place this file as the agent's system prompt or as `CLAUDE.md` in an empty working directory; fill §0.
2. Launch: `claude --model claude-sonnet-5 --permission-mode acceptEdits` (or the Agent SDK equivalent with Read/Write/Edit/Glob/Grep/Bash/Task enabled) and say: **"Begin. RESUME=auto."**
